[B]I got {Hand of Elbereth} but I haven`t a clue what it does.

Hand of Elbereth gives you several intrinsics and if you're carrying a
long sword, a nice surprise! it was easier in 2.3e to notice the
intrinsics because H.ofE. was so easy to come by. in 3.0 you may already
have the intrinsics by the time you get H.ofE. i vaguely remember 5
intrinsics associated with H.ofE. the only one of which you would notice
immediately is "see invisible" if you were invisible at the time you got
it. in reference to 2.3e you could probably figure out the intrinsics.
anybody who gets H.ofE. can go to hell ...

oh yeah, there is a price to pay for this gift of self-sufficiency. i pray
that you don't find out too soon what that price is ...

